OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,8,Fcalled a crisis cabinet meeting on
OL,9,FMonday morning as wildfires continue
OL,10,Fto blaze across parts of France and
OL,11,FSpain.
OL,13,FAbout 325,000 people have been
OL,14,Fevacuated across France and Spain,
OL,15,Fwith 220,000 fleeing a wildfire in the
OL,16,FFrench Gironde region, near Bordeaux.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
