OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FIn Gironde, where wildfires have
OL,8,Fburned an area four times the size of
OL,9,FParis, officials said the situation
OL,10,Fovernight had remained "largely
OL,11,Fstable" after days of the blaze moving
OL,12,Ftowards the wine-producing city of
OL,13,FBordeaux.
OL,15,FStrong winds and dry conditions have
OL,16,Fmade it difficult for crews to fight
OL,17,Fthe fire in southwest France, which
OL,18,Fhas been burning since Wednesday,
OL,19,Fscorching 42,000 hectares.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
