OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FNow a fourth heatwave is on the way,
OL,8,Fbringing temperatures as high as 40C
OL,9,Fand adding further fuel to the flames.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, Macron thanked those who
OL,12,Fhad helped to tackle the fires and
OL,13,Fcountries that have provided
OL,14,F"invaluable support".
OL,16,FBordeaux airport said it is still
OL,17,Foperating as usual, with bus and tram
OL,18,Fservices still available.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
