OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FBordeaux Mayor Thomas Cazenave said
OL,8,Fthe blaze is approximately 15
OL,9,Fkilometres from Bordeaux, but the city
OL,10,Fhas not yet evacuated its population
OL,11,Fof 268,000.
OL,13,FFirefighters are also tackling blazes
OL,14,Fin the Landes and Var regions,
OL,15,Fbringing the total number of evacuees
OL,16,Fin the country to more than 250,000.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
