OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FIn central Spain, the ground is still
OL,8,Fsmouldering as wildfires have scorched
OL,9,Fapproximately 77,000 hectares.
OL,11,FTens of thousands of people have been
OL,12,Fevacuated in Avila, Madrid, Toledo and
OL,13,FValencia.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, a man died in a wildfire
OL,16,Fin the Valencia suburb of Manises.
OL,18,F"We have lost everything," said Vanesa
OL,19,FMunoz, mayor of Casavieja, in the
OL,20,FAvila region.
