OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,F"People have lost their businesses and
OL,8,Fwe are left here abandoned," she added.
OL,10,FSpain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,11,Fhas called for governments to work
OL,12,Ftogether to fight climate change.
OL,14,FAcross Italy, operations continue to
OL,15,Ftackle wildfires, with planes and
OL,16,Fhelicopters arriving from Naples,
OL,17,Femergency services confirmed.
