OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FA fire broke out in a Mediterranean
OL,8,Fpine forest in Puglia, southern
OL,9,FItaly, and beachgoers were evacuated
OL,10,Fas plumes of smoke were seen billowing
OL,11,Fabove.
OL,13,FEmergency services are using water
OL,14,Ftankers to help fight the blaze, but
OL,15,Fthere are concerns over its proximity
OL,16,Fto areas popular with tourists.
OL,18,FThere have been no fatalities in the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
