OL,3,CMacron calls crisis talks as wildfires
OL,4,Cin Spain and France force 300,000 to
OL,5,Cflee
OL,7,FIn his Sunday prayers, Pope Leo XIV
OL,8,Fpaid respects to those affected by the
OL,9,Fwildfires across Europe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
